{
  "_comment": "Seccomp profile for the Plenith agent container.",
  "_doc": [
    "This profile starts from Docker's default seccomp profile and removes",
    "syscalls the agent doesn't need. The agent is a Python process running",
    "asyncssh + httpx + the orchestrator state machine. It does NOT need:",
    "  - mount/umount/pivot_root (no filesystem reorganization)",
    "  - reboot, swapon/swapoff, sethostname (no host control)",
    "  - kexec_load, init_module, finit_module (no kernel module loading)",
    "  - ptrace, process_vm_*, perf_event_open (no debugging / introspection)",
    "  - bpf (no eBPF — Docker default already denies; explicit here)",
    "  - keyctl, add_key, request_key (no kernel keyring)",
    "  - clock_settime, settimeofday, adjtimex (no time manipulation)",
    "  - clone with CLONE_NEWUSER (no unshare to user namespaces)",
    "",
    "Apply with:",
    "  docker run --security-opt seccomp=deploy/security/seccomp-agent.json ...",
    "or in docker-compose:",
    "  services:",
    "    agent:",
    "      security_opt:",
    "        - seccomp=./deploy/security/seccomp-agent.json",
    "",
    "Verify the syscall list against the running container with:",
    "  docker run --rm --pid=container:<id> nicolaka/netshoot \\",
    "    sh -c 'strace -f -c -p 1' (and wait 60s for a representative sample)"
  ],

  "defaultAction": "SCMP_ACT_ERRNO",
  "defaultErrnoRet": 1,
  "archMap": [
    {
      "architecture": "SCMP_ARCH_X86_64",
      "subArchitectures": [
        "SCMP_ARCH_X86",
        "SCMP_ARCH_X32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "architecture": "SCMP_ARCH_AARCH64",
      "subArchitectures": [
        "SCMP_ARCH_ARM"
      ]
    }
  ],

